        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027052",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Any product candidates that we successfully develop and commercialize will compete with existing therapies and new therapies that may become available in the future.",
        "start_character": 90550,
        "end_character": 90715
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027052",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027052-a1969541f8bbd378",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027052",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "However, we inherited the manufacturing and pre-clinical data generated by the prior sponsor of our lead product candidate which we believe will reduce the timeline for regulatory approval by two to three years.",
        "start_character": 61535,
        "end_character": 61746
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027052",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027052-a1969541f8bbd378",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027052",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our commercial opportunity could be reduced or eliminated if our competitors develop and commercialize products that are safer, more effective, have fewer or less severe side effects, are more convenient or are less expensive than any products that we may develop.",
        "start_character": 91458,
        "end_character": 91722
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027052",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027052-a1969541f8bbd378",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027052",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We anticipated that this decision would allow us to advance this first-in-class, FDA QIDP/Fast Track-designated antibiotic product candidate to Phase 3 clinical trials more expeditiously.",
        "start_character": 15432,
        "end_character": 15619
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027052",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027052-a1969541f8bbd378",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027052",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Based upon advice from our scientific advisors, we believe ACX-375C, our second antibiotic candidate currently in pre-clinical development, will also be eligible for FDA’s QIDP and fast track designations.",
        "start_character": 22805,
        "end_character": 23010
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027052",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027052-a1969541f8bbd378",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027052",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we believe ibezapolstat’s profile provides an opportunity to develop significant market penetration of patients with recurrent infection following use of one of the initial-episode treatment options because of its unique mechanism of action.",
        "start_character": 89768,
        "end_character": 90022
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027052",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027052-a1969541f8bbd378",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027052",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Through our outside manufacturing vendors, we will continue to monitor the stability of DS and DP on an ongoing basis as we continue to advance the clinical development program.",
        "start_character": 84350,
        "end_character": 84527
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027052",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027052-a1969541f8bbd378",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027052",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We acquired worldwide rights to manufacture, develop and commercialize ibezapolstat from GLSynthesis Inc.",
        "start_character": 18621,
        "end_character": 18726
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027052",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027052-a1969541f8bbd378",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027052",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We anticipate filing for and receiving QIDP Designation as well as “Fast Track” with FDA in the next 24 months for ACX-375C, both of which designations have been granted by FDA for ibezapolstat, our lead antibiotic program.",
        "start_character": 107031,
        "end_character": 107254
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027052",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027052-a1969541f8bbd378",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027052",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are also developing a systemic pol IIIC GPSS oral and IV antibiotic.",
        "start_character": 112139,
        "end_character": 112210
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027052",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027052-a1969541f8bbd378",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027052",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe the patent and regulatory coverage already in place provides strong protection for the commercialization of ibezapolstat and we will continue to consider additional patent submissions as we review available pre-clinical and clinical data as it becomes available throughout the development program.",
        "start_character": 105313,
        "end_character": 105621
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027052",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027052-a1969541f8bbd378",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027052",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe we are developing the first DNA pol IIIC inhibitor that is ready to enter Phase 3 clinical trials and have clinically validated the efficacy of our lead pol IIIC antibiotic candidate in a Phase 2 clinical trial.",
